sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI as bomify build or distribute
    participant Plugin as bomify-plugin binary
    participant Disk as Data directory

    CLI->>CLI: detect a kind from the component's purl type
    CLI->>CLI: find the matching binary on PATH

    alt bomify build
        rect rgb(236, 253, 245)
            CLI->>Plugin: component pull, over a subprocess call
            Plugin->>Disk: read or write the component's artifact
            Plugin->>Disk: write its own log output, never to stdout
            Plugin-->>CLI: a single JSON result on stdout
        end
        CLI->>Disk: record the component's manifest
        Note over CLI,Disk: --check: component pull --check instead - no Disk access,<br/>no manifest recorded
    else bomify distribute
        CLI->>Plugin: component remote, over a subprocess call
        Plugin-->>CLI: a single JSON RemoteResult on stdout
        CLI->>CLI: resolve an endpoint - an explicit --remote flag,<br/>else the best-matching conf/distribution.json rule
        rect rgb(236, 253, 245)
            CLI->>Plugin: component push, over a subprocess call
            Plugin->>Disk: read the component's artifact
            Plugin->>Disk: write its own log output, never to stdout
            Plugin-->>CLI: a single JSON result on stdout
        end
        Note over CLI,Disk: --check: component push --check instead - no Disk access
    end
